	(text "CMS-012 | MECHANICAL CARD DETECT\nMP2/MP4 open without card; closed with card. Independent of card VDD.\nR72=10k: 9801..10201 ohm; R73=1k: 980.1..1020.1 ohm (1% + 100C TCR).\nScreen: VCC=3.0..3.6V; I_leak=2.1uA; contact Rc=0.14 ohm (qualification assumption).\nVhigh=VCC-I_leak*(R72+R73) >=2.976435V.\nVlow=VCC*Rc/(R72+Rc)+I_leak*(R73+R72||Rc) <=0.002194V.\nCorrelated 0.8/0.2 VCC logic margins >=0.576435/0.597814V.\nHeld contact current 291.984..369.410uA; R72 power <1.323mW.\nHirose 1mA is a resistance test, not a proven wetting minimum.\nNo filter capacitor. P406 input-only/pulls off; >=20ms stable debounce REQUIRED.\nWetting, ESD and fault-slew qualification OPEN; card power/data bus incomplete.\nFull Python-verified calculations: CMS-012 in camera_storage_interfaces.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 208.28 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/camera_storage_interfaces.md#cms-012-independent-mechanical-microsd-card-detect")
		)
		(uuid "1f718b83-23fd-4e36-9330-5d027d5d3684")
	)
